This grant covers the independent client implementation, not copied third-party
material, imported configuration data, generated upstream descriptors, backend
libraries or material a contributor has no authority to license.
Required Notice: Copyright (c) 2026 Embercade contributors.

2. Upstream integration contributions
Original Embercade contributions in integration/batocera, the Batocera and
EmulationStation patch directories, and the explicitly mapped integration tests,
smoke script and build/install scripts are available under the MIT license in
LICENSES/MIT.txt.
This is a GPL/LGPL-compatible grant for OWN contributions. Foreign patch
