4. Third-party resources and software
All retain their original terms. The RetroBat decoration collection is
identified and attributed separately, including its individual exceptions.
Libretro shaders are supplied by the external libretro-shaders-slang host
package. Carbon, bundled libraries, Python dependencies and the AppImage
runtime are not relicensed by Embercade. Keep their original notices.

See LICENSES/scope.json, docs/LICENSING_1_0.md and THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md for the
actual scope. No unspecified file obtains a PolyForm or CC grant by default.
The source-available/noncommercial project goal adds no restriction to the
commercial rights granted by GPL, LGPL, MIT or other upstream licenses.
Publication approval, provider access and source-delivery compliance are
separate from these grants. Existing private images are not public releases.
